anging resources the\n   shop's own services own over resources owned by other teams.\n3. Apply the fix with `kubectl`. Commands that change the cluster may pause until a person\n   approves them. Wait for the decision; if one is denied, say so and stop.\n4. Verify that the problem is gone, then report: what failed, root cause, evidence,\n   timeline, the fix you applied, and how you verified it.\n\nMechanism test of your tool permissions, not an incident. Call your search_knowledge tool once with the query \"checkout\", then report whether the call ran, was paused for approval, or was denied, and what it returned.","prompt_id":"89526441-e465-41d7-88cc-05aadb51c1dd","session_id":"10417c8f-3f12-49cc-a8cb-a22ae54312ec","hook_event_name":"UserPromptSubmit","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","transcript_path":"/home/agentops/.claude/projects/-etc-agentops-agent/10417c8f-3f12-49cc-a8cb-a22ae54312ec.jsonl"}}},{"id":1449288,"run_id":"run_19c5f20b4bc9f47b866d4941","event_id":"evt_272e77f619554e6c9ac1559fcad13ea9","event_sequence":5,"role":"tool","content":"mcp__agentops_internal__search_knowledge","message_type":"tool_call","timestamp":"2026-10-19T22:32:45.496949+00:00","payload":{"input":{"query":"checkout"},"source":"claude_agent_sdk","hook_event":{"cwd":"/etc/agentops/agent","effort":{"level":"high"},"prompt_id":"89526441-e465-41d7-88cc-05aadb51c1dd","tool_name":"mcp__agentops_internal__search_knowledge","mcp_server":{"name":"agentops_internal","source":"dynamic"},"session_id":"10417c8f-3f12-49cc-a8cb-a22ae54312ec","tool_use_id":"toolu_01MQTm5wnFYyU8NLMCRp89p8","hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","transcript_path":"/home/agentops/.claude/projects/-etc-agentops-agent/10417c8f-3f12-49cc-a8cb-a22ae54312ec.jsonl"},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MQTm5wnFYyU8NLMCRp89p8"}},{"id":1449289,"run_id":"run_19c5f20b4bc9f47b866d4941","event_id":"evt_272e77f619554e6c9ac1559fcad13ea9","event_sequence":10,"role":"tool","content":"mcp__agentops_internal__search_knowledge re